[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 9126.67, "timestamp": "02:32:06", "text": "バナナ？待って、茹でていない。あ、すみません。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9128.27, "timestamp": "02:32:08", "text": "えっと、"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 9130.745, "timestamp": "02:32:10", "author": "@Ninja477", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/DgHpXlaDuDSPk2w40fljKZE0ZpWffCKDHKYfP2DNO6YWP5QEr5mBRcLrJDjF8KH0euY0GnYAF6c=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "don't ask joq about cooking maomao. he doesn't know a thing"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9131.95, "timestamp": "02:32:11", "text": "待って。ええ、蒸してもいいと思います。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9136.71, "timestamp": "02:32:16", "text": "あまりにも。バナナを蒸すとか、何か別のことをする。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 9138.091, "timestamp": "02:32:18", "author": "@Ninja477", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/DgHpXlaDuDSPk2w40fljKZE0ZpWffCKDHKYfP2DNO6YWP5QEr5mBRcLrJDjF8KH0euY0GnYAF6c=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "tch tch Mr. nix."}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9138.309, "timestamp": "02:32:18", "text": "なぜバナナを茹でろと言っていたのですか？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9147.11, "timestamp": "02:32:27", "text": "えっと、待って。ええ、卵は"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 9149.924, "timestamp": "02:32:29", "author": "@Ninja477", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/DgHpXlaDuDSPk2w40fljKZE0ZpWffCKDHKYfP2DNO6YWP5QEr5mBRcLrJDjF8KH0euY0GnYAF6c=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "steamed banana??"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9159.71, "timestamp": "02:32:39", "text": "混乱したのでベッドへ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9163.19, "timestamp": "02:32:43", "text": "そう、蒸したバナナ。あなたはそれを知っています"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9165.27, "timestamp": "02:32:45", "text": "蒸し器のことですが、お湯を沸かすと、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9168.07, "timestamp": "02:32:48", "text": "そしてそれを底部のコンパートメントに入れ、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9170.309, "timestamp": "02:32:50", "text": "上部の穴は中央です"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9172.23, "timestamp": "02:32:52", "text": "コンパートメントにバナナを入れる"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 9174.366, "timestamp": "02:32:54", "author": "@Ninja477", "a